首先代表奎师那教派登场的是马克·李。
First to go for the
Hare Krishnas was Mark Lee.

1186
00:51:36,400 --> 00:51:39,240
三、二、一，发车！
Three, two, one, go.

1187
00:51:40,360 --> 00:51:42,320
他直接把油门踩到底了。
And he gave it everything.

1188
00:51:42,340 --> 00:51:43,980
♪ Jesus Loves You - Bow Down Mister ♪
♪ Jesus Loves You - Bow Down Mister ♪

1189
00:51:44,000 --> 00:51:47,360
行啊，这开法出人意料地凶残。
All right. It's surprisingly aggressive.

1190
00:51:49,040 --> 00:51:51,320
他有点紧张，
毕竟这车马力实在太狂暴了。
He's a little bit nervous
because it's a powerful car.

1191
00:51:51,360 --> 00:51:53,440
确实。
- 但但愿，
It is.
- But, hopefully,

1192
00:51:53,480 --> 00:51:56,080
在他内心深处，
还能保有一丝平静。
in the back of his mind,
he'll be kind of calm.

1193
00:51:56,120 --> 00:51:57,920
好嘞，走，我们去给他助助阵。
- 必须的。
Right, well, let's give him that support.
- Absolutely.

1194
00:51:57,960 --> 00:52:00,160
真没想到你们还组团过来了，太赞了！[笑]
I can't believe you came in
a group, that's great. [LAUGHS]

1195
00:52:06,120 --> 00:52:07,680
噢，跑得相当顺啊。
Oh, he's going well.

1196
00:52:07,720 --> 00:52:10,200
这架势开得真够豁得出去的。
This is some pretty committed driving.

1197
00:52:10,240 --> 00:52:11,680
我只求他能把这个弯切过去……
I just want him to make this corner...

1198
00:52:13,320 --> 00:52:14,880
漂亮！过去了！
Yeah. He did it.

1199
00:52:14,920 --> 00:52:16,720
哦唷！
Ooh.

1200
00:52:16,760 --> 00:52:18,560
哎哟我的妈，他滑出去了！
Ooh, my word, he's gone.

1201
00:52:20,040 --> 00:52:21,600
我的天呐。
Oh, my word.

1202
00:52:23,800 --> 00:52:25,160
[哔——]
[BLEEP]

1203
00:52:26,960 --> 00:52:29,600
[全场大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

1204
00:52:33,280 --> 00:52:36,640
[全场掌声]
[ALL APPLAUDING]

1205
00:52:36,680 --> 00:52:39,960
下一位，皮尼·邓纳拉比，
就是撞毁2CV的那位。
Next up, Rabbi Pini Dunner,
the 2CV crasher.

1206
00:52:40,000 --> 00:52:42,080
三、二、一。
Three, two, one.

1207
00:52:48,080 --> 00:52:50,120
鉴于这位拉比毫无赛车经验，
Due to the Rabbi's lack of experience,

1208
00:52:50,160 --> 00:52:53,560
斯提格主动提出
在他的计时圈担任领航员。
The Stig offered to act
as co-driver on his timed lap.

1209
00:52:56,640 --> 00:52:59,840
我看我们需要来点
跨教派的强力神圣加持。
I think we need some big
inter-denominational support.

1210
00:52:59,880 --> 00:53:02,040
冲啊！
Come on!

1211
00:53:02,080 --> 00:53:04,840
但即便集齐各大宗教的庇佑善念，
But the collective goodwill
of all religions

1212
00:53:04,880 --> 00:53:06,840
也没法让他老老实实守在
wasn't enough to keep him
on the racing line

1213
00:53:06,880 --> 00:53:08,280
神圣的正义赛车线上。
of righteousness.

1214
00:53:13,800 --> 00:53:15,760
[全场欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

1215
00:53:17,680 --> 00:53:21,040
那么，金刚乘佛教徒仁增
能表现得更好吗？
So, could Rigzin
the Vajrayana Buddhist do better?

1216
00:53:21,080 --> 00:53:24,240
我得先声明，我这辈子
I should make it clear that
I have never done anything

1217
00:53:24,280 --> 00:53:26,120
还从没干过这么刺激的事。
like this in my life ever.

1218
00:53:26,880 --> 00:53:28,600
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

1219
00:53:38,400 --> 00:53:40,240
寺里长老曾叮嘱他要开出
His Elders had instructed him to drive

1220
00:53:40,280 --> 00:53:41,600
光速般的境界，
at the speed of light,

1221
00:53:41,640 --> 00:53:43,680
而他居然完全照字面意思去狂飙了。
and he was taking them quite literally.

1222
00:53:46,800 --> 00:53:51,000
就连“禅宗大师”斯提格
都被他镇住了。
Even the Zen Master,
Stig, was impressed.

1223
00:53:51,040 --> 00:53:53,760
但他对刘易斯主教
也能刮目相看吗？
But would he be impressed
with the Bishop of Lewes?

1224
00:53:56,120 --> 00:53:58,120
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

1225
00:54:04,320 --> 00:54:07,160
[轮胎尖叫]
[TYRES SCREECH]

1226
00:54:08,680 --> 00:54:10,960
好多了。
Much better.

1227
00:54:11,000 --> 00:54:12,280
下一位，夺冠大热门，
Next up, the hot favourite,

1228
00:54:12,320 --> 00:54:13,920
来自“天启车队”的
the Reverend Antony Feltham-White

1229
00:54:13,960 --> 00:54:15,360
安东尼·费尔瑟姆-怀特牧师。
from Revelation Racing.

1230
00:54:16,880 --> 00:54:18,960
他果然没让人失望。
And he didn't disappoint.

1231
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:21,720
二挡，这个弯提早切入弯心。
Second gear, apex this one early.

1232
00:54:21,760 --> 00:54:24,520
拐进去，扎进去，切进去。
Get it in, get it in, get it in.

1233
00:54:25,160 --> 00:54:26,720
油门踩到底。
Push it hard.

1234
00:54:26,760 --> 00:54:30,960
♪ 万物光明与奇妙 ♪
♪ All things bright
and wonderful

1235
00:54:31,000 --> 00:54:34,040
谁有这胆魄？谁敢这么冲？
Who's got the nerve?
Who's got the nerve?

1236
00:54:34,080 --> 00:54:37,480
重踩刹车，拐进去，提早吃弯。
Hard on brakes, take it in,
take the bend early.

1237
00:54:37,520 --> 00:54:39,160
提早进弯。
Take the bend early.

1238
00:54:39,200 --> 00:54:41,360
哈蒙德：瞧瞧这架势！
HAMMOND: Look at that go.

1239
00:54:41,800 --> 00:54:43,320
啊。
Ah.

1240
00:54:43,360 --> 00:54:45,600
啊，啊。漂亮！
Ah, ah. Yes.

1241
00:54:45,640 --> 00:54:47,720
♪ 主上帝
拯救了万民 ♪
♪ The Lord God
saved them all ♪

1242
00:54:49,560 --> 00:54:51,320
这圈跑得真是好到吓人。
That was scarily good.

1243
00:54:51,360 --> 00:54:53,840
哈蒙德：英国圣公会奉献了堪称神迹的一圈。
HAMMOND: A truly biblical lap
from the Church of England.

1244
00:54:53,880 --> 00:54:56,840
但罗马天主教会同样志在必得。
But the Roman Catholic Church
was equally determined.

1245
00:54:56,880 --> 00:54:58,280
走起。
Go.

1246
00:55:01,680 --> 00:55:04,280
看着杀气腾腾啊。
看来他是动真格的了。
Looked committed.
I think he means business.

1247
00:55:04,300 --> 00:55:07,300
♪ 圣母修道院修士 -
《脱离狮口》 ♪
♪ Monks of the Abbey of Notre Dame -
De Ore Leonis ♪

1248
00:55:09,720 --> 00:55:11,480
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECH]

1249
00:55:18,240 --> 00:55:20,560
[观众鼓掌]
[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

1250
00:55:21,440 --> 00:55:22,520
不是吧。
No.

1251
00:55:23,960 --> 00:55:27,600
好了，成绩单就在我手里，
Now, I have the results here,

1252
00:55:27,640 --> 00:55:29,520
但在揭晓之前，
but before we get to that,

1253
00:55:29,560 --> 00:55:32,760
这就是他们刚才开的那辆车，瞧见没？
this is the car they were driving. Okay?

1254
00:55:32,800 --> 00:55:35,000
我们跟借车给我们的车主说的是，
We told the people we'd borrowed it from

1255
00:55:35,040 --> 00:55:37,040
借给几位牧师开开而已。
they were just a few vicars.

1256
00:55:37,080 --> 00:55:40,480
绝对不可能出半点岔子。
[全场大笑]
Couldn't possibly come to any harm.
[ALL LAUGHING]

1257
00:55:40,520 --> 00:55:42,880
看看这儿！看看下面这块。
Look at this! Look at this down here.

1258
00:55:42,920 --> 00:55:46,840
再瞧瞧底盘被折腾成什么样了。
[全场大笑]
And look what happened underneath.
[ALL LAUGHING]

1259
00:55:46,880 --> 00:55:49,600
彻底撞烂撞断了。
Smashed off and broken.

1260
00:55:49,640 --> 00:55:54,040
所以，你们这帮人里到底是谁干的？
So, which one of you lot is responsible?

1261
00:55:55,360 --> 00:55:57,560
[全场大笑]
赶紧的，主动坦白吧。
[ALL LAUGHING]
Come on, own up.

1262
00:55:57,600 --> 00:56:01,720
是主教。是主教干的。
The bishop. The bishop is responsible.

1263
00:56:01,760 --> 00:56:03,720
[全场鼓掌]
[ALL APPLAUDING]

1264
00:56:05,000 --> 00:56:07,560
那么，有谁……
Now, who...

1265
00:56:07,600 --> 00:56:10,600
有谁想看看他是怎么撞成这样的？
Who would like to see how he did it?

1266
00:56:10,640 --> 00:56:13,080
观众：想！
- 放录像！
AUDIENCE: Yes.
- Play the tape.

1267
00:56:13,120 --> 00:56:15,760
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECH]

1268
00:56:18,040 --> 00:56:21,240
[全场惊呼]
[ALL EXCLAIMING]

1269
00:56:21,280 --> 00:56:24,120
得，真相大白了。您感觉如何？
Well, there we are. How do you feel?

1270
00:56:25,320 --> 00:56:26,680
绝不忏悔。
Unrepentant.

1271
00:56:26,720 --> 00:56:28,800
[全场大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

1272
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:32,080
甚好。
Very good.

1273
00:56:33,360 --> 00:56:36,920
行了，揭晓成绩的时候到了。
Right, time for the results.

1274
00:56:36,960 --> 00:56:39,880
理查德，赏脸一起过来吗？
- 必须的。
Richard, will you care to join me.
- Oh yes.

1275
00:56:39,920 --> 00:56:43,640
排在最后一名，遗憾的是
今天没能来上班的，
In last place, and sadly
not here at work,

1276
00:56:43,680 --> 00:56:47,480
来自“哈瑞·撞车派”——现在大家都这么叫了——马克·李。
Mark Lee from Hare Crashna,
as it's now known.

1277
00:56:47,520 --> 00:56:50,440
1分56秒。
One minute 56 seconds.

1278
00:56:50,480 --> 00:56:53,080
第五名，皮尼·邓纳拉比。
In fifth place, Rabbi Pini Dunner.

1279
00:56:53,120 --> 00:56:57,600
你确实撞了车，这有什么好意外的？成绩是1分55秒。
You did crash. How surprised
can you be? With one minute 55.

1280
00:56:57,640 --> 00:57:01,200
第四名，来自佛教界的，
In fourth place, from the Buddhists,

1281
00:57:01,240 --> 00:57:04,611
是仁津（Rigzin），原谅我用了简称，
干得漂亮，
it's Rigzin, forgive me from
being abbreviative, well done,

1282
00:57:04,636 --> 00:57:05,960
成绩是一分四十五秒。
one minute 45 seconds.

1283
00:57:06,000 --> 00:57:07,400
获得第三名的是，
And in third place,

1284
00:57:07,440 --> 00:57:09,960
虽然把我们借来的车给彻底报销了……
despite ruining the car that we borrowed...

1285
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:11,520
[众人大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

1286
00:57:11,560 --> 00:57:13,520
英国国教会的
华莱士·本恩主教，
Bishop Wallace Benn,
Church of England,

1287
00:57:13,560 --> 00:57:16,320
成绩自然是一分四十二秒。
of course, one minute 42 seconds.

1288
00:57:16,360 --> 00:57:19,800
最后两位，是直接正面对决，
厮杀在
So last two, it's a straight
two cornered fight between

1289
00:57:19,840 --> 00:57:22,520
罗马天主教会
和英国国教会之间。
the Roman Catholic church
and the Church of England.

1290
00:57:22,560 --> 00:57:25,520
这简直就是重回十六世纪！
And it's the 16th century all over again.

1291
00:57:26,480 --> 00:57:29,360
天主教屈居第二。
The Catholics come in second.

1292
00:57:29,400 --> 00:57:33,000
西蒙·汤普森神父，成绩一分四十秒，
Father Simon Thompson with one minute 40,

1293
00:57:33,040 --> 00:57:34,640
这意味着胜者……
which means the winner...

1294
00:57:34,680 --> 00:57:37,440
跑得最快的信仰是英国国教会，
The fastest faith is the Church of England,

1295
00:57:37,480 --> 00:57:39,600
车手是安东尼·费尔瑟姆-怀特牧师！
and the Reverend Antony Feltham-White.

1296
00:57:39,640 --> 00:57:41,280
[众人欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

1297
00:57:43,960 --> 00:57:45,520
还有杰森……
And Jason...

1298
00:57:48,520 --> 00:57:50,360
非常感谢大家。
Thank you very much.

1299
00:57:50,400 --> 00:57:52,680
[众人欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

1300
00:57:56,360 --> 00:57:58,280
噢，妙极了。
Oh. Delightful.

1301
00:57:59,680 --> 00:58:04,320
今天的节目到这里
就差不多结束了。
And that is pretty much
the end of the show.

1302
00:58:04,360 --> 00:58:06,800
瞅瞅那条公交专用道。
Looking at the bus lane.

1303
00:58:06,840 --> 00:58:08,840
得了，上面还是连个鬼影都没有，
No, still nothing going on there,

1304
00:58:08,880 --> 00:58:11,040
我看下周咱们也别费劲搞任何
I think next week we won't
bother doing anything to do

1305
00:58:11,080 --> 00:58:12,640
跟环保沾边的事了。
with the environment.

1306
00:58:12,680 --> 00:58:13,960
事实上，我看咱们甚至可以去踹死两只仓鸮
In fact, I think we might kick
a couple of barn owls

1307
00:58:14,000 --> 00:58:15,560
纯找乐子。
to death just for fun.

1308
00:58:15,600 --> 00:58:18,680
其实下周我们要测评纯正的驾驶者之车。
In fact, we are going
to be doing drivers cars.

1309
00:58:18,720 --> 00:58:21,600
四百匹马力是入场的最低门槛。
Four hundred horsepower is
the minimum level for entry.

1310
00:58:21,640 --> 00:58:24,440
我们还要把我们的铃木Liana
We are also going to be
turning our Suzuki Liana

1311
00:58:24,480 --> 00:58:28,320
改造成阿加烤炉，把一辆拉达改造成莲花。
into an Aga and a Lada into a Lotus.

1312
00:58:28,360 --> 00:58:30,160
下周见，晚安！
See you then. Goodnight.

1313
00:58:30,920 --> 00:58:32,280
[众人欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

